# SteinOS package overrides — Green Edition
# Derived from AcreetionOS packages.x86_64 v2.0 (minimal Cinnamon base).
# Package overrides use archiso syntax: plain lines add packages,
# "-pkg" lines remove them. This brand variant keeps the base desktop
# and adds optional patriotic/quality-of-life extras (commented below).

# --- SteinOS recommended extras (uncomment to add) ---
# neofetch        # show your SteinOS pride in the terminal
# figlet          # big bold slogans: "MAKE LINUX GREAT AGAIN"
# cowsay          # wise patriotic cows
# htop            # keep an eye on the swamp (processes)
# firefox         # the Green way to browse
# libreoffice-fresh
# gimp
# vlc
# flatpak
